      "source": "# Expected Results\n02 10\n03 15\n04 7\n05 15\n06 100\n07 125\n09 15\n10 42\n11 6 8\n12 11 2.5\n13 42\n14 77\n15 15\n16 42\n17 7 tuple\n18 7\n19 3\n20 5\n21 INSIDE then DESTRUCTOR\n22 INIT_ONCE?\n23 ONLY AFTER_INIT (no repeated INIT_ONCE)\n24 1\n25 2\n26 with input 7 -> 49\n27 expected compile error\n28 expected runtime error/non-zero exit\n29 run separately -> SUITE3_MAIN\n30 run separately -> SUITE3_TRAILING_MAIN\nCritical: explicit static state should persist; ordinary cell variables should remain isolated; static init output must not repeat; diagnostics must point to the correct cell.",
      "outputs": [],
      "executionCount": null,
      "status": "idle",
      "executionTime": null
