          "type": "error",
          "text": "Compilation Error\n\nC:\\Users\\gupta\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cppbook-wlx95fh_\\main.cpp:11:17: error: 'App' has not been declared\n using namespace App::Config;\n                 ^~~\nC:\\Users\\gupta\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cppbook-wlx95fh_\\main.cpp:11:22: error: 'Config' is not a namespace-name\n using namespace App::Config;\n                      ^~~~~~\nC:\\Users\\gupta\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cppbook-wlx95fh_\\main.cpp:11:28: error: expected namespace-name before ';' token\n using namespace App::Config;\n                            ^\ncppnb_cell_cell_fa507ed9_2d82_455c_b663_dd10dad59063.cpp: In function 'int __cppbook_user_main_cell_fa507ed9_2d82_455c_b663_dd10dad59063()':\nCell 33, line 88, column 18: error: 'M' has not been declared\nCell 33, line 89, column 18: error: 'M' has not been declared\nCell 33, line 100, column 26: error: 'add' was not declared in this scope\nCell 33, line 100, column 26: note: suggested alternative:\nCell 33, line 7, column 9: note: 'Math::add'\nCell 33, line 105, column 36: error: 'enabled' was not declared in this scope\nCell 33, line 105, column 36: note: suggested alternative:\nCell 33, line 32, column 14: note: 'App::Config::enabled'\n",
